  "methodology": {
   "definitions": [
    "Long-term migrant movements under Stats NZ's outcomes-based measure (a traveller is counted as a migrant if they spend 12 of the following 16 months in, or out of, New Zealand). Mean estimates, in people. Estimates for the most recent months are provisional and are revised as travel outcomes become known.",
    "Monthly figures are mean estimates; year-ended figures are Stats NZ's published rolling twelve-month totals. The two are different series and are never combined."
   ],
   "notes": [
    "Figures are the unrounded values in Stats NZ's published data files; the release headline text may state rounded figures.",
